# Class A two groups deep, in an assignment: in `v: ((k + j) * 1U) + 0U` the outer group beside `+ 0U` holds the mixed
# group beside `* 1U`, and each is the expression its fields make.  Refused at the assignment, as a flat mixed value
# assigned is (unit_free_assign_mixed_refused).
fn: m () size_t
    int: k 5
    size_t: j 2U
    size_t: v 0U
    v: ((k + j) * 1U) + 0U
    return: v

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
